msgid "The store keeps its tables as they are, and takes changes again. The release that needed this change can never be made current, in this domain or any other domain using the store: it has to be built again. The new fields stay reserved with the meaning this change gave them: a later version can add them again only exactly as they were. The values already filled in stay in the records, unseen. This can't be undone."
